  data: {
    LLM: '1. The dealer deals one card face-up in the center (The **House Card**).\n2. Players place bets on either Andar or Bahar.\n3. **The First Deal Rule**: If the House card is **Black** (Clubs/Spades), the first card is dealt to Andar. If it is **Red** (Hearts/Diamonds), it is dealt to Bahar.\n4. The dealer continues dealing cards alternately to Andar and Bahar until a card of the same rank as the House card appears.',
    Player: '1. The dealer deals one card face-up in the center (The **House Card**).\n2. Players place bets on either Andar or Bahar.\n3. **The First Deal Rule**: If the House card is **Black** (Clubs/Spades), the first card is dealt to Andar. If it is **Red** (Hearts/Diamonds), it is dealt to Bahar.\n4. The dealer continues dealing cards alternately to Andar and Bahar until a card of the same rank as the House card appears.',
    objective: 'Predict which of the two piles (Andar or Bahar) will be dealt a card that matches the rank of the House card.',
    gameplay: '1. The dealer deals one card face-up in the center (The **House Card**).\n2. Players place bets on either Andar or Bahar.\n3. **The First Deal Rule**: If the House card is **Black** (Clubs/Spades), the first card is dealt to Andar. If it is **Red** (Hearts/Diamonds), it is dealt to Bahar.\n4. The dealer continues dealing cards alternately to Andar and Bahar until a card of the same rank as the House card appears.',
